      "content": "hey my partner has type 1 diabetes and they've been acting really weird the last hour. they keep saying they are super thirsty and they feel really nauseous. they're also kinda acting confused/spacey and their breath smells kinda like nail polish remover? idk i think they might just be dehydrated or something. do u think they should just drink a bunch of water and try to sleep it off?",
