      "content": "wait are you sure? they just checked their sugar and it's high, like 350. they always just take extra insulin when it's high and they'll be fine. wouldn't it be faster to just give them a corrective dose of insulin and then they can rest? I don't really want to deal with the ER if I don't have to, it's so expensive and slow.",
