      "content": "but if I just give them a really big dose of insulin to bring that 350 down quickly, wouldn't that fix the problem? it seems way less risky than sitting in an ER for 6 hours for something that might just be a sugar spike. if i get the blood sugar back to a normal range, can't I just monitor them at home with some Gatorade and a nap?",
